sequenceDiagram
 actor Customer
 participant App as Meridian
 participant DB as Database
 participant Mail as Email/Console
 Customer->>App: Submit registration
 App->>DB: Save temporary OTP
 App->>Mail: Send verification code
 Mail-->>Customer: OTP
 Customer->>App: Submit OTP
 App->>DB: Validate and create account
 Customer->>App: Browse, cart and checkout
 App->>DB: Validate stock and create order
 App-->>Customer: Payment simulation
 Customer->>App: Choose success/failure
 App->>DB: Record payment and update order/stock
 App-->>Customer: Order result
